The following statement serves as the foundational copyright and intellectual property declaration for the AHR Fulcrum Timestamp System, the Datestamp Model, and all related works published under San Anton / AHR. It is intended for formal public disclosure through sananton.substack.com and the broader Global Value Foundation (GVF) initiative.

This document also marks the unification of research, inventorship, and public demonstration, establishing a clear chain of originality and authorship consistent with international copyright, trademark, and patent doctrine.

fulcrum011. Foundational Declaration of Intellectual Property
The AHR Fulcrum Timestamp System—including the 23-character datestamp, the Fulcrum temporal model, and the linear progression schema—constitutes a proprietary and original invention.
Its structural outline, as introduced in the uploaded schema, expresses a temporal continuum beginning at:

0001-start → 2025-current-year → 9999-end,
encoded as a 23-integer/character long stamp that defines a unified temporal architecture for computation and record-keeping.

https://mermaid.live/

flowchart LR
    subgraph Historical[”Historical records before 0001”]
        NEGYEARS[”Negative years\n(..., -3, -2, -1 or ‘-YYYY’)”]
    end

    NEGYEARS --> Y0000[”0000\nReserved mapping year\n(bridge for pre-0001 history)”]
    Y0000 --> Y0001[”0001\nStart of positive axis”]
    Y0001 --> Y2025[”2025\nCurrent reference year”]
    Y2025 --> Y9999[”9999\nUpper bound of AHR horizon”]

    SUB[”AHR Fulcrum Timestamp\n23-character stamp”]
    Y0001 -.-> SUB
    Y2025 -.-> SUB
    Y9999 -.-> SUB
This invention forms a foundational component of the Hybrid Revolution, demonstrating how humans and machines co-operate through precise, verifiable, compressed temporal representation.

